-- Not a table. The row count of the most recent INSERT, UPDATE or DELETE on this connection,
-- which is how a guarded write (E37, R23c, R23d) reports whether it wrote anything. SQLDelight's
-- generated mutators return nothing, so this is the one way to ask.
--
-- Read it inside the same transaction as the write it describes (data/Writes.kt does), so no
-- other statement on the connection can land between the two.
rowsChanged:
SELECT changes();
